ype":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T04:55:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T04:55:05Z","body":"Re: garbage in icons. The canvas draw call has a clear parameter now. \r\nSee https://thorvg.github.io/thorvg.site/api/doc/structtvg_1_1Canvas.html#a369e6ce47423522f8dbaa38af763daa2\r\nChanging draw calls to `sw_canvas->draw(true);` should fix this. Or clearing the buffer that's passed in `std::fill(buffer.begin(), buffer.end(), 0);`\r\nI'll do some more testing tomorrow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3882117933/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883868089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024#issuecomment-3883868089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024","id":3883868089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nfx-5","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T11:35:31Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T11:35:31Z","body":"> Re: garbage in icons. The canvas draw call has a clear parameter now. See https://thorvg.github.io/thorvg.site/api/doc/structtvg_1_1Canvas.html#a369e6ce47423522f8dbaa38af763daa2 Changing draw calls to `sw_canvas->draw(true);` should fix this. Or clearing the buffer that's passed in `std::fill(buffer.begin(), buffer.end(), 0);` I'll do some more testing tomorrow.\r\n\r\nYup, this seems to have been the issue, no icon appears to be broken now (tested on a GHA artifact):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"469\" height=\"264\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/234c30ee-e12f-4ad8-8260-48c865ceb205\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3883868089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3888630651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024#issuecomment-3888630651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024","id":3888630651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nx8t7","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-12T04:31:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-12T04:31:51Z","body":"Ran some more test. Performance with 1.0.0 seems to be roughly the same as in 0.15.\r\n\r\nRe: `sw_canvas->draw(true);` the clear param does not seem to be needed in the text servers. I guess freetype provides a cleared glyph bitmap. I.e. test project with svg glyphs below showed no garbage without the clear param.\r\n\r\nTest project contains a ttf with two svg glyphs. I only looked at the Godot FPS counter to check performance.\r\n[svg_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25250694/svg_test.zip)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3888630651/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3893841735","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024#issuecomment-3893841735","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024","id":3893841735,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oF09H","user":{"login":"Maran23","id":66004280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDA0Mjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66004280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23","html_url":"https://github.com/Maran23","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maran23/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-12T22:54:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-12T22:54:44Z","body":"One thing we also can check is to not use `Smart Rendering`. Which seems to enable some kind of dirty tracking in the SVG. Since we render static (SVG) icons, this might not be needed and we save a bit of performance.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"808\" height=\"684\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae245d97-87f9-4714-8749-d25dd1eaf4d6\" />\r\n<img width=\"776\" height=\"352\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/391c2bea-f1c6-400a-a6f9-ef2f23fdade8\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nSee also: https://www.thorvg.org/post/thorvg-v1-0-a-new-generation-released","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3893841735/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3894218135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024#issuecomment-3894218135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024","id":3894218135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oHQ2X","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T00:56:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T00:56:41Z","body":"> One thing we also can check is to not use `Smart Rendering`. Which seems to enable some kind of dirty tracking in the SVG. Since we render static (SVG) icons, this might not be needed and we save a bit of performance.\r\n\r\nIt's not enabled in our [config](https://github.com/Chubercik/godot/blob/87c30b7054a1636df14dddfd2b9fc06e82a1d440/thirdparty/thorvg/inc/config.h) (i.e. no `THORVG_PARTIAL_RENDER_SUPPORT`). ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3894218135/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3904381242","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024#issuecomment-3904381242","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024","id":3904381242,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ouCE6","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T12:38:46Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T12:38:46Z","body":"Thought I had it for a second, but we're still leaking memory, will have to take a closer look again later on. 😪\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3904381242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3904483292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024#issuecomment-3904483292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024","id":3904483292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oua_c","user":{"login":"hermet","id":3711518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MTE1MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3711518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet","html_url":"https://github.com/hermet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hermet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T13:41:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T13:41:29Z","body":"> Thought I had it for a second, but we're still leaking memory, will have to take a closer look again later on. 😪\r\n\r\n@Chubercik Please share the leak details; I may be able to help. Thanks.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3904483292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3904499124","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024#issuecomment-3904499124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024","id":3904499124,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oue20","user":{"login":"Chubercik","id":37378746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3Mzc4NzQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37378746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik","html_url":"https://github.com/Chubercik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chubercik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-15T13:52:22Z","updated_at":"2026-02-15T13:52:22Z","body":"> > Thought I had it for a second, but we're still leaking memory, will have to take a closer look again later on. 😪\r\n> \r\n> @Chubercik Please share the leak details; I may be able to help. Thanks.\r\n\r\nHi, I think I got it; the issue was that after the API change some `unique_ptr`s turned raw and thus had to be managed manually - which is no problem, but `delete` couldn't be invoked on `SwCanvas` (at least I'm pretty sure it didn't want to compile on my end due to protected methods or something). So after dabbling around I just wrapped it in `unique_ptr` again and sanitizers seem to be happy now, so maybe we're all good.\r\n\r\nEither way, thanks for your support on this matter.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3904499124/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3936350371","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116024#issuecomment-3936350371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116024","id":3936350371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qn_Cj","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/use